title: WilliamGote_Intro
position: 942,215
---
Narrator: A middle-aged man marches in, the extraneous zippers and chains on his outfit clinking with each heavy bootstep.
Narrator: He crashes into his seat and glares at you.
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 11>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Empathy: [Em]He keeps glancing at your badge. His face contorts with disgust each time. [/Em]
Empathy: [Em]There's something oddly familiar about the way this man grimaces.[/Em]
<<endif>>
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 7>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Force: [Fo]Oh yeah, this guy fucking [b]HATES[/b] you. Can't imagine why.[/Fo]
<<endif>>
Punk: ...
-> Good afternoon, citizen.
    Punk: ...
-> Hello there, friend!
    Punk: ...Yo.
    <<set $william_respect = $william_respect + 1>>
-> Is there something on my face? #skillcheck:Force:11
    <<set $william_respect = $william_respect - 1>>
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 11>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
        <<detour WilliamGote_Problem_Pass>>
    <<else>>
        <<detour WilliamGote_Problem_Fail>>
    <<endif>>
Punk: Lets just get this over with.
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===

