title: WilliamGote_Hub
position: 1230,741
---
You look at your compliance form.
-> Please state your name. <<once>>
    <<jump WilliamGote_Name>>
-> What is your current occupation? <<if not $asked_occupation>>
    <<jump WilliamGote_Occupation>>
-> Do you consider yourself loyal to the second republic? <<if not $asked_loyalty>>
    <<jump WilliamGote_Loyalty>>
-> I have everything I needed from you. Thank you. <<if $asked_name and $asked_occupation and $asked_loyalty>>
    <<jump WilliamGote_End>> 
===

// ==========================
// ===== NAME ===============
// ==========================
title: WilliamGote_Name
position: 321,343
---
Punk: Billy's the name.
<<form_set_name YarnManager "Billy">>
<<set $asked_name = true>>
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 4>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Insight: [In]Hold up, mononymity was outlawed by the Second Republic in June of 28 AT, over twelve years ago. Something's off.[/In]
Force: [Fo]He lied to us! He wanted us to fill out his name wrong on the form.[/Fo]
    <<if is_name_filled()>>
        Force: [Fo]Good thing we didn't write his name down already, right?[/Fo]
        Force: [Fo]...[/Fo]
    <<else>>
        Force: [Fo]Thank God you haven't filled that name out yet. You'd be really stupid if you had.[/Fo]
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
Punk: Uh... hello? I just told you my name's Billy, can we keep it movin'?
-> Sounds good to me.
    <<set $william_respect -= 1>>
    Punk: I'm sure it does.
-> That's a strange name.
    <<set $william_respect -= 1>>
    Punk: Well, its the one I got, so fill it out, boy scout.
-> Your full name can't be just 'Billy'. <<if $last_check_success>> #skillcheck:Force:6 
    <<set $william_respect -= 1>>
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 6>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    <<detour WilliamGote_Name_PassNode>>
    <<else>>
    <<detour WilliamGote_Name_FailNode>>
    <<endif>>
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===

title: WilliamGote_Name_PassNode
position: -128,328
---
Force: [Fo]That's right, we're not [i]just[/i] powerful, we're smart too.[/Fo]
Insight: [In]You're welcome.[/In]
Punk: You figured it out, oh wise hand of the Republic. Billy's not my government name.
<<form_set_name YarnManager "William">>
Punk: My pals call me Billy, but the name my ma gave me is William.
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 11>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Insight: [In]William's tone rises and shifts into an accent as he mentions his mother. Its sound was recorded in a different time.[/In]
<<endif>>
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 8>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Empathy: [Em]We knew of a 'William', from before we actualized into who we are now.[/Em]
<<endif>>
-> Thank you, William.
    <<set $william_respect += 2>>
-> William... what? What's your last name?
    <<form_set_name YarnManager "William Gote">>
    Punk: William Gote. Not that you care, but its pronounced more like the facial hair than the animal.
    -> Thank you.
        <<set $william_respect += 1>>
        Punk: Whatever.
    -> It's about time you complied.
        Punk: Fuck you.
        <<set $william_respect -= 2>>
    -> I do care. Thank you for clarifying. #skillcheck:Empathy:10
        <<set $william_respect += 1>>
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 11>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
        <<detour WilliamGote_Care_Pass>>
    <<else>>
        <<detour WilliamGote_Care_Fail>>
    <<endif>>
===

