// ==========================
// ===== OCCUPATION =========
// ==========================
title: WilliamGote_Occupation
position: 368,-180
---
<<form_set_occupation YarnManager "Courier">>
Punk: I'm a bike-courier for Devon Mail.
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 10>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Insight: [In]Devon Mail is a coast-to-coast postal business whose marketing features its motorbike-driving mail delivery force. The comapny promises efficient service and limited questions asked.[/In]
<<endif>>
Punk: I was en-route to a delivery when I was stopped for compliance. The republic has a knack for timing.
Force: [Fo]He's grinning. What does he know?[/Fo]
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 8>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Empathy: [Em]He's being sarcastic, obviously.[/Em]
<<endif>>
-> The Republic has a knack for everything a loyal citizen might require.
    <<set $william_respect -=  1>>
    Punk: Yeah, you guys are [i]real[/i] efficient.
-> My apologies. Understand that routine checks are vital to maintaining our communities. <<if $last_check_success>> 
    <<set $william_respect += 1>>
    Punk: Tell that to my schedule.
-> Sounds like bad timing. Sorry about that.
    <<set $william_respect += 2>>
    Punk: You could say that.
Punk: That compliance stop didn't just fuck up my day, it made me miss a gig. 
<<if $william_respect >= 1>>
    Force:[Fo]A gig? Like a band gig? This guy's in a band? OK-play it cool.[/Fo]
    -> A gig? You're in a band?
        <<detour WilliamGote_Band>>
<<endif>>
<<set $asked_occupation = true>>
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===

title: WilliamGote_Band
---
Punk: ...Yeah.
Punk: Didn't peg you for the curious type.
<<if $william_respect >= 2>>
    Punk: Yeah, I'm in a band.
<<else>>
    Punk: Just something on the side.
<<endif>>
Force: [Fo]No way. This guy? In a band?[/Fo]
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 8>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Empathy: [Em]He's relaxed a bit. This must be his joy.[/Em]
<<endif>>
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Irrelevant. Stay focused. This is not why he's here.[/Fo]
-> What kind of music do you play?
    <<set $william_respect += 1>>
    Punk: Loud. Fast. The kind your bosses wouldn't like much.
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 8>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    Force: [Fo]Fuck yeah.[/Fo]
    <<endif>>
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 9>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    Insight: [In]Unregulated gatherings in unmonitored locations.[/In]
    <<endif>>
    The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Lame! Can you imagine [b]listening[/b] to non-state-sanctioned music? Smells like dissent, to me.[/Fo]
-> Sounds like a waste of time.
    <<set $william_respect -= 1>>
    Punk: I guess it would to a guy like you.
    Punk: You got your forms. I got my buddies and my bass.
-> That’s… actually kind of cool.
    <<set $william_respect += 1>>
    Punk: Heh.
    Punk: Didn’t think I'd hear that from behind that desk.
    <<if $william_respect >= 2>>
        Punk: We play where we can. Not exactly sanctioned venues.
        Insight: [In]They play in locations that avoid official oversight.[/In]
        The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Ugh! Unregistered gatherings are such a drag, right?[/Fo]
    <<endif>>
<<if $william_respect >= 2>>
    -> Do you play often?
        Punk: Whenever we stop at a new district. My buddies and I are all couriers, actually.
        Punk: It's not hard to find a venue that'll take us in.
        Force: [Fo]'Take us in'. What are they, wandering minstrels?[/Fo]
<<endif>>
Punk: Anyway.
Punk: Not like it matters to you.
===

// ==========================
// ===== LOYALTY ============
// ==========================
title: WilliamGote_Loyalty
---
Punk: The Republic's been paying my bills for years and now they want to question my loyalty?
Punk: Funny how that works.
-> Do you consider yourself loyal?
    Punk: I'm still here.
    <<set $asked_loyalty = true>>
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 9>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    Insight: [In]That wasn't an answer. That was a deflection.[/In]
    Empathy: [Em]And yet, some part of you knows what he means.[/Em]
    <<endif>>
    -> That's not what I asked.
        <<set $william_respect -= 1>>
        <<if $william_respect >= 1>>
            Punk: Yeah, I know.
            Punk: But you aren't getting a different answer from me, today.
        <<else>>
            Punk: Then maybe ask a better question.
        <<endif>>
    -> Still here?
        <<set $william_respect += 1>>
        <<jump WilliamGote_Loyalty_StillHere>>
    -> Whatever you say.
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===

title: WilliamGote_Loyalty_StillHere
---
Punk: I'm still here, you're still here. 
Punk: Some people aren't.
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 8>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Empathy: [Em]There's no sarcasm this time. He's watching you carefully.[/Em]
<<endif>>
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]He is playing some form of rhetorical trick on you. Don't fall for it. [/Fo]
-> People relocate all the time.
    <<set $william_respect -= 1>>
    Punk: Yeah.
    Punk: I'm sure that's all it is.
-> What do you mean?
    <<set $william_respect += 1>>
    <<if $william_respect >= 2>>
        <<jump WilliamGote_Loyalty_Open>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump WilliamGote_Loyalty_Closed>>
    <<endif>>
-> That's not my concern.
    <<set $william_respect -= 1>>
    Punk: Funny.
    Punk: Seems like it should be.
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===

title: WilliamGote_Loyalty_Closed
---
Punk: Means you keep your head down, you stay useful... you get to keep breathing, get to keep knowing people.
Punk: Simple as that.
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===

title: WilliamGote_Loyalty_Open
---
Punk: Means people who ask the wrong questions... or know the wrong people... or just get unlucky...
Punk: ...they stop showing up.
Insight: [In]The Second Republic maintains that there have been no unexplained dissappearances in over two decades.[/In]
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 12>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Empathy: [Em]He's not trying to scare you. He's checking if you already know.[/Em]
Empathy: [Em]And you [b]DO[/b]. Remember his face, his laughter.[/Em]
<<endif>>
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]These claims are unverified. Do not engage.[/Fo]
Punk: After seeing enough people gone, the rest of us stay loyal.
Punk: Or we learn how to look like it.
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===

