title: WilliamGote_End
---
Punk: So that's it, yeah?
Punk: I walk out, you file your little paper, we both pretend this meant something.
<<if is_form_complete() == false>>
    The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Hold up, Jonny-boy! You're about to submit an incomplete compliance form![/Fo]
    -> (Go back and finish the form)
        The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Good. Procedure exists for a reason.[/Fo]
        <<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
    -> (Submit anyway)
        The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Cutting corners, are we? Let's hope that doesn't become a habit.[/Fo]
        <<jump WilliamGote_End_Determine>>
<<else>>
    -> That's right. You're free to go.
        <<jump WilliamGote_End_Determine>>
<<endif>>
===

title: WilliamGote_End_Determine
---
<<if $william_respect >= 3>>
    <<jump WilliamGote_End_Trust>>
<<else>>
    <<jump WilliamGote_End_Standard>>
<<endif>>
===

title: WilliamGote_End_Trust
---
Punk: ...
Punk: Hey, before I go...
Punk: You ever get people coming through here that get dealt with a little differently?
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Uh oh.[/Fo]
-> Everyone who comes through here is processed the same.
    <<set $william_respect -= 1>>
    Punk: Yeah, I figured.
    The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Perfect response. I'm proud of you, kiddo![/Fo]
    <<jump WilliamGote_End_Standard>>
-> Depends on what you mean.
    <<set $william_respect += 1>>
    Punk: I got a buddy. He calls himself Sticky Drums.
    Force: [Fo]Sticky Drums? That's the worst name I've ever heard.[/Fo]
    Punk: Good guy. Plays the keys in our band. He's kind of an... unsubtle idiot.
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 8>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
        Empathy: [Em]He's practically glowing. He loves this 'Sticky Drums', even his godawful name.[/Em]
    <<endif>>
    Punk: He has a compliance check tomorrow morning before we head out. If he ends up in your office...
    Punk: Just... Don't look too hard, yeah?
    Punk: He's a good man. That should be all that matters.
    Punk: But I know that's not how this works.
    The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]I don't think I need to point this out, but this is a direct request to undermine procedure.[/Fo]
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 14>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
        Empathy: [Em]"Where there is an opportunity to do good, you take it."[/Em]
        Empathy: [Em]That's what he taught you.[/Em]
    <<endif>>
    -> I can't do that.
        <<set $william_respect -= 2>>
        Punk: Yeah, I didn't think you could.
        Punk: Worth a shot.
        <<jump WilliamGote_End_Standard>>
    -> I'll keep that in mind.
        <<set $william_respect += 1>>
        Punk: That's all I'm asking.
        Punk: Anyways, thanks for not being a complete piece of shit.
        <<jump WilliamGote_Exit>>
===

title: WilliamGote_End_Standard
---
-> You're free to go.
Punk: Yeah, real generous of you.
Punk: Try not to lose any sleep over it.
<<jump WilliamGote_Exit>>
===

title: WilliamGote_Exit
---
He stands, adjusts his jacket, ensuring his zippers hang lazily, and heads for the door.
Punk: See you around, Arbiter.
<<if $william_respect <= 1>>
    The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]You've conquered this challenge well! Have no fear, the process will come down on him shortly.[/Fo]
<<endif>>
<<form_submit YarnManager>>
===
